# =====================================================
# SkyAInet — .gitignore (Version 6.1)
# =====================================================

# === Rust / Cargo ===
target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock

# === Build & Artifacts ===
*.o
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.exe
*.bin
*.out

# === Logs & Debug ===
*.log
*.trace
logs/
debug/

# === IDE & Éditeurs ===
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*\~
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace

# === OS spécifiques ===
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# === Environnement & Secrets ===
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
secrets/
keys/
config/local.toml
config/production.toml

# === Tests & Benchmarks ===
**/__snapshots__/
**/*.profraw
**/*.profdata

# === Documentation générée ===
docs/
target/doc/

# === Autres ===
*.bak
*.tmp
*.swp
*.orig
Session.vim
.netrwhist

# === Optionnel : si tu veux ignorer les dépendances locales ===
# crates/*/target/